210 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 98 0 R
/E (Boats are insured with Third Party and Kasko policy with deductible. Standard Deposits or "SailSafe" Formula will cover all damages caused or suffered from boats during the charter up to a maximum equal to the deposit itself. In the event of damages exceeding the deposit, the excess is covered by insurance policies. If the damages do not exceed the amount of the deposit left by the customer, the difference will be refunded. If there are no damages, the whole amount will be returned.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
